  "group_descriptions": {
    "*** Trust matrix ***": "Trust matrix:\nHigh: Confirmed by multiple credible and independent sources.\nMedium: Plausible with partial corroboration or one strong source.\nLow: Single-source, weakly supported, conflicting, or unconfirmed.",
    "*** Respiratory / close contact ***": "Respiratory / close contact:\nSpread by air, droplets, or close contact. Includes flu, COVID, measles, TB, strep (including invasive disease), meningococcal disease, and unnamed respiratory clusters.\nPrevention: Stay home if ill, improve ventilation, and follow isolation guidance from public health.",
    "*** Food, water, and gut ***": "Food, water, and gut:\nSpread by food, water, or feces. Includes foodborne and waterborne outbreaks, hepatitis A, and unnamed GI illness.\nPrevention: Use safe water, wash hands after the bathroom, and cook and store food properly.",
    "*** Blood, animal, and insect ***": "Blood, animal, and insect:\nSpread by blood, sex, animals, or insects. Includes rabies, mosquito- and tick-borne disease, viral hemorrhagic fever, and similar.\nPrevention: Avoid bites and animal saliva, do not touch blood, and use PPE if you must give care.",
    "*** Exposure ***": "Exposure:\nNot a normal infection. Chemical, radiation, nuclear, or an unknown biological agent.\nPrevention: Get upwind or out of the area, avoid plume and runoff, and wait for official decontamination guidance."
  },
